{"about_the_game":"<strong>Focus Find</strong> is a 2D narrative thriller puzzle game.<br><br><strong>Unravel a Mystery:</strong> Immerse yourself in this narrative-driven puzzle platformer game. Journey through the depths of Adam's damaged mind. Dr. Bardell is trying to help him remember his past. However, forgotten memories lead to hidden truths.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949950/extras/540e15c7a9a82c3596bb528b2ab2279b.poster.avif?t=1758888117\" width=508 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949950/extras/540e15c7a9a82c3596bb528b2ab2279b.webm?t=1758888117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949950/extras/540e15c7a9a82c3596bb528b2ab2279b.mp4?t=1758888117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Process Grief:</strong> Travel through 98 levels across the 5 stages of grief. &quot;The treatment only works with grief. Grief encompasses a wide range of emotions, stimulating most of the brain over long periods of time.&quot;<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949950/extras/69589762a7469b44cde60b8ea36299dc.poster.avif?t=1758888117\" width=508 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949950/extras/69589762a7469b44cde60b8ea36299dc.webm?t=1758888117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949950/extras/69589762a7469b44cde60b8ea36299dc.mp4?t=1758888117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Explore:</strong> Focus Find features environmental puzzles where Adam must connect, poke, shoot, ride and break his surroundings to progress.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949950/extras/1cc1d1d2ca2e00502c6e1f2db146a766.poster.avif?t=1758888117\" width=508 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949950/extras/1cc1d1d2ca2e00502c6e1f2db146a766.webm?t=1758888117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949950/extras/1cc1d1d2ca2e00502c6e1f2db146a766.mp4?t=1758888117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>The Enemy Within:</strong> The enemies in Adam's mind come in many forms. Are you ready to face them?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949950/extras/9336530daf0f0a4480227cf204aa473f.poster.avif?t=1758888117\" width=508 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949950/extras/9336530daf0f0a4480227cf204aa473f.webm?t=1758888117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949950/extras/9336530daf0f0a4480227cf204aa473f.mp4?t=1758888117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Experience a thrilling adventure with over 10 game mechanics unlocked throughout the game</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>98 meticulously crafted puzzle levels</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Avoid a multitude of enemy types, each with their own unique challenges</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Step into the surreal world of this sci-fi thriller, traveling through the 5 stages of grief</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Experience an unforgettable journey with a debut soundtrack by the talented Matthew Parisi</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Immerse 